{
    "title": "Kaz Warrior 2: Warzone & RPG",
    "description": "<b>Play adventure game: Kaz Warrior 2 \u2013 ninja game<b>\r\n\r\nIf you like playing the adventure games, Kaz Warrior 2 \u2013 ninja game can be the good choice for you.\r\nIn ninja game, players control Kaz, a young Ninja who has strong desire to become a powerful warrior to protect his village from evil dark bosses. With strong will, Kaz learns how to evade and eliminate evil bosses, step by step towards the greater goal of defeating the Evil Lord - the fearsome ruler of the area and save his people in village.\r\n\r\n<b>Amazing - Adventure Games<b>\r\n\r\nAction in Kaz Warrior - Ninja game is viewed from the third person, and advanced movements such as running, jumping, double jumping,.. Let's enjoy an emotional experience as you unlock more levels and win in Kaz Warrior. Are you ready to play this role playing game?\r\n\r\nFeatures of Kaz warrior 2 \u2013 Ninja Game:\r\n\u2b50 Ultimate HD graphics with amazing eye catching colors!\r\n\u2b50 Fun filled but realistic samurai sound effects\r\n\u2b50 This is very different from other RPG\r\n\u2b50 Great fun filled ninja game for all\r\n\u2b50 Superb adventure games entertainment for everyone\r\n\u2b50 Beautiful and awesome warriors characters: ninja, enemies, big bosses,..\r\n\u2b50 Awesome, simple and smooth but competitive samurai gameplay\r\n\u2b50 Absolutely addictive RPG\r\n\u2b50 You can play offline without wifi\r\n\u2b50 Exciting samurai killing experience\r\n\u2b50 Train yourself to get intelligence skills easily and quickly\r\n\u2b50 Amazing samurai game, which is loved by everybody\r\n\u2b50 The more you win levels of adventure games, collect the rewards of gold and gems!\r\n\u2b50 Play for as long as possible and never get bored with RPG\r\n\u2b50 Disappear your samurai with stealth mode to become undetectable by enemies!\r\n\u2b50 You can upgrade character health, attacking power and dash attack\r\n\u2b50 You can remove ads in this Ninja game!\r\n\u2b50 Multilingual support, English, Italian, Korean, German, Spanish, French, Russian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese etc!\r\n\r\nChallenging Gameplay in ninja game:\r\nIt looks like simple gameplay, but the challenges are not simple. You have to save your samurai from barriers like platform gaps to make the game a more adventurous RPG. You also have to face special PVP enemy flamethrowers, just like players will throw shuriken and kunai to defeat enemies to win.\r\nAfter completing the zone in, you will have to win a boss fight to unlock the next zone and get bigger rewards. The warriors are ready to PVP fights with increasing difficulty level. So always you need to be very active and use your special RPG intelligence to win. If you are an expert in RPG fighting, you can beat levels more easily!\r\n\r\nWe will always update the game every month and will add new levels!\r\nLearn more about the ninja game!\r\nPlease contact us if you have any questions or suggestions about this game.</b></b></b></b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Play adventure game: Kaz Warrior 2 \u2013 ninja game<b><br><br>If you like playing the adventure games, Kaz Warrior 2 \u2013 ninja game can be the good choice for you.<br>In ninja game, players control Kaz, a young Ninja who has strong desire to become a powerful warrior to protect his village from evil dark bosses. With strong will, Kaz learns how to evade and eliminate evil bosses, step by step towards the greater goal of defeating the Evil Lord - the fearsome ruler of the area and save his people in village.<br><br><b>Amazing - Adventure Games<b><br><br>Action in Kaz Warrior - Ninja game is viewed from the third person, and advanced movements such as running, jumping, double jumping,.. Let&#39;s enjoy an emotional experience as you unlock more levels and win in Kaz Warrior. Are you ready to play this role playing game?<br><br>Features of Kaz warrior 2 \u2013 Ninja Game:<br>\u2b50 Ultimate HD graphics with amazing eye catching colors!<br>\u2b50 Fun filled but realistic samurai sound effects<br>\u2b50 This is very different from other RPG<br>\u2b50 Great fun filled ninja game for all<br>\u2b50 Superb adventure games entertainment for everyone<br>\u2b50 Beautiful and awesome warriors characters: ninja, enemies, big bosses,..<br>\u2b50 Awesome, simple and smooth but competitive samurai gameplay<br>\u2b50 Absolutely addictive RPG<br>\u2b50 You can play offline without wifi<br>\u2b50 Exciting samurai killing experience<br>\u2b50 Train yourself to get intelligence skills easily and quickly<br>\u2b50 Amazing samurai game, which is loved by everybody<br>\u2b50 The more you win levels of adventure games, collect the rewards of gold and gems!<br>\u2b50 Play for as long as possible and never get bored with RPG<br>\u2b50 Disappear your samurai with stealth mode to become undetectable by enemies!<br>\u2b50 You can upgrade character health, attacking power and dash attack<br>\u2b50 You can remove ads in this Ninja game!<br>\u2b50 Multilingual support, English, Italian, Korean, German, Spanish, French, Russian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese, Chinese, Japanese etc!<br><br>Challenging Gameplay in ninja game:<br>It looks like simple gameplay, but the challenges are not simple. You have to save your samurai from barriers like platform gaps to make the game a more adventurous RPG. You also have to face special PVP enemy flamethrowers, just like players will throw shuriken and kunai to defeat enemies to win.<br>After completing the zone in, you will have to win a boss fight to unlock the next zone and get bigger rewards. The warriors are ready to PVP fights with increasing difficulty level. So always you need to be very active and use your special RPG intelligence to win. If you are an expert in RPG fighting, you can beat levels more easily!<br><br>We will always update the game every month and will add new levels!<br>Learn more about the ninja game!<br>Please contact us if you have any questions or suggestions about this game.</b></b></b></b>",
